      ],
      "problem": "Every operations team needed its own dashboard, and each one was hand-built. Shipping a new tool took weeks and the UIs drifted apart.",
      "approach": "Designed a component layer driven by configuration: tables, filters, forms and charts described in data, with escape hatches for custom widgets. Restructured state so real-time views re-render only what changed.",
      "outcome": "New dashboards became mostly configuration. 12+ shipped across 70+ pages, including surge pricing, zonal promotions and lifecycle tools, in three languages."
    },
