      "problem": "Notes in a GitHub repo are hard to read on a phone and impossible to ask questions of.",
      "approach": "Render Markdown from the repo with a Redis cache in front of GitHub's API, plus session caching in the browser. A retrieval pipeline chunks and embeds the notes so a chatbot can answer from them.",
